{"3437020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gyra", "steam_appid": 3437020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Online third person shooter adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Intense and exciting Boss battles, rich and varied. Monster category</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Item affixes full of surprises and random drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Fight with pistols, rifles, shotguns and melee weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, human beings have been freed from the bondage of the body and have mastered the ability to incarnate fantasy bodies. The best warriors among men can even stand up to the gods. Then the abuse of the ability leads to the blurring of the boundary between fantasy and reality......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a new recruit, solve various world anomalies, and strengthen yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: Death is not the end. Any powerful affix could easily change the course of the war.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Online third person shooter adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Intense and exciting Boss battles, rich and varied. Monster category</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Item affixes full of surprises and random drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Fight with pistols, rifles, shotguns and melee weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, human beings have been freed from the bondage of the body and have mastered the ability to incarnate fantasy bodies. The best warriors among men can even stand up to the gods. Then the abuse of the ability leads to the blurring of the boundary between fantasy and reality......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a new recruit, solve various world anomalies, and strengthen yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: Death is not the end. Any powerful affix could easily change the course of the war.</p>", "short_description": "Gyra is a third-person shooter action game based on Unreal Engine 5. Here, players will be incarnated as fantasy bodies, fighting with monsters from various worlds, looting resources, and improving abilities. Free with no in-app purchases, still under development.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437020/abd79b3a37d5afbe22f48bc30a83b9ffc8c6c2a8/header.jpg?t=1747400100", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437020/6eb9e0b8f299b6f827ce795fa7d13ad1a05eef21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747400100", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437020/6eb9e0b8f299b6f827ce795fa7d13ad1a05eef21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747400100", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> The 12th generation i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> The 14th generation i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX4070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet con